---
import PageContainer from "@components/PageContainer.astro";
import BasePageLayout from "@layouts/BasePageLayout.astro";
---

<BasePageLayout title="About">
    <PageContainer>
        <!-- <div class="box"> -->
        <!--     <h2>FS-3</h2> -->
        <!-- </div> -->
        <div class="box">
            <h2>Projects</h2>
            <p>
                These days I spend most of my time in Formula Slug's lab space
                doing embedded programming, PCB design & debugging, wire
                harnessing, telemetry and data analysis, or whatever else needs
                doing to prepare for our next racecar. Currently we're working
                on FS-5, which is set to compete next June!
            </p>
            <p>Here are a bunch of projects I care about:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://github.com/formulaslug/fs-4-firmware"
                        >FS-4 Firmware</a
                    >: The firmware for Formula Slug's latest racecar! Including
                    throttle control, BMS, dash screens, data acquisition &
                    logging, traction control, state-of-charge estimation, CAN
                    bus management, drivers for various sensors, and the rest of
                    the racecar's business logic. I led a team of ~10 firmware
                    developers to bring this to life from the ground-up!
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://github.com/formulaslug/fs-4-schematics"
                        >FS-4 Schematics</a
                    >: The PCB designs for Formula Slug's latest racecar! I am
                    very proud of my impact on this monumental team effort, from
                    implementing our first custom STM32 design and fixing
                    last-second BMS and battery temp sense PCB mistakes, to
                    testing nearly every aspect of the electrical system and
                    getting the motor spinning just days before competition.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://github.com/Bvngee/nixconf/tree/main"
                        >NixOS config</a
                    >: The culmination of my years using Linux, learning how
                    operating systems work, and my descent into madness trying
                    to build the perfect dev environment (&gt;450 commits deep).
                    Nowadays I couldn't bear to live without it.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://github.com/Bvngee/SAR">SAR project</a
                    >: I helped develop and test my highschool's brand new
                    electronics class, leading tons of fun research, embedded
                    programming, and debugging. This is the result of that!
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://github.com/Bvngee/bvngee.com"
                        >bvngee.com</a
                    >: Written and hosted from scratch using only Astro, nginx,
                    and some bash. Automated deployment, manual SSL, etc (see <a
                        href="/writing/website-explanation">this post</a
                    >). Fun learning experience!
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://github.com/Bvngee/BvngeeAddons"
                        >BvngeeAddons</a
                    >: My personal set of client-side fixes & features for
                    Minecraft 1.17, including screenshot management utils,
                    improved boss bar rendering, bug fixes, and more! Made
                    purely for myself to resolve my own annoyances with the
                    game.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coordinate-mod"
                        >CoordinateMod</a
                    >
                    and <a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/anti-auto-jump"
                        >AntiAutoJump</a
                    >: My first two Minecraft mods, around 16k downloads (circa
                    2020)
                </li>
                <!-- <li> -->
                <!--     <a -->
                <!--         target="_blank" -->
                <!--         rel="noopener noreferrer" -->
                <!--         href="https://discord.gg/94EYHt8qgw">Oracle SMP</a -->
                <!--     >: My technical Minecraft server - farms, automation, -->
                <!--     redstone, etc - all the nerdy stuff. (2020-2024) -->
                <!-- </li> -->
                <li>
                    A bunch of other stuff (<a
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        href="https://github.com/Bvngee?tab=repositories&type=source"
                        >GitHub</a
                    >): Experiments, C++/Rust adventures, assignments, etc.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </PageContainer>
</BasePageLayout>
<style>
    .box {
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background-color: var(--bg2);
        box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 0px 5px 10px;
        margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .box > p {
    }
    .box > h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
    }
    .box li {
        /* add a little vertical space between bullets */
        margin: 0.5em 0;
    }
    #about-title {
        margin: 0 10px;
        /* text-shadow: 2px 4px 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); */
    }
    #resume-container {
    }
    #resume {
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        /* max-width: 40em; */
        max-width: 8.5in;
        max-height: 11in;

        aspect-ratio: 8.5 / 11;
        /* height: 11in; */
        display: block;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0px 5px 10px;
        filter: brightness(85%);
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
</style>
